{"product_id":"an-unsuitable-boy","title":"An Unsuitable Boy","description":"\u003cp\u003eKaran Johar is synonymous with success, panache, quick wit, and outspokenness, which sometimes inadvertently creates controversy and makes headlines. KJo, as he is popularly called, has been a much-loved Bollywood film director, producer, actor, and discoverer of new talent. With his flagship Dharma Productions, he has constantly challenged the norms, written and rewritten rules, and set trends. But who is the man behind the icon that we all know?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBaring all for the first time in his autobiography, An Unsuitable Boy, KJo reminisces about his childhood, the influence of his Sindhi mother and Punjabi father, obsession with Bollywood, foray into films, friendships with Aditya Chopra, SRK and Kajol, his love life, the AIB Roast, and much more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis book is both the story of the life of an exceptional filmmaker at the peak of his powers and of an equally extraordinary human being who shows you how to survive and succeed in life.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:25 x 240  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Karan Johar \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780670087532 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43548696182937,"sku":"11RB9780670087532","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/249ebd6dbbabeb66cc084dc688d7ef6d.jpg?v=1698919514","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/an-unsuitable-boy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}